{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>פרעהו</b> — from <b>ותפרעו</b> (\"and it is annulled\"), as in <b>למפרע</b> (\"backward, undone\")." "<b>שטה</b> — turn aside."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {0 "Ibn Ezra is arguing that פרע here carries the sense of 'undo/annul' (as in למפרע), citing ותפרע (likely from Hosea 10:7)."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:03.183540309Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}